  era: "Palaeolithic \xB7 Section 1 \xB7 Prehistoric India \xB7 c. 1.5 million years ago \u2013 700 BCE"
  title: Palaeolithic sites
  text: Key Palaeolithic sites include Attirampakkam in Tamil Nadu, Hunsgi and Isampur in Karnataka, Bhimbetka in Madhya Pradesh, Didwana in Rajasthan, the Belan valley in Uttar Pradesh, Hathnora on the Narmada, and the Sohan valley, now in Pakistan.
